                  "text": "\u2022 KK4 Downstream 500 / 504 / 14 s \u2192 MITIGATED (retry + breaker + pool per system)"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\u2022 KK5 Retried write runs twice \u2192 FIXED if tools honour idempotency keys"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
